{"version":1,"content":"<p>前有線娛樂新聞台主播、現年49歲的「美魔女」劉明軒（Vivian）一向熱愛運動、保養得宜。</p><p>然而，她昨日（24日）在社交平台上載於聖保祿醫院拍攝的照片，透露自己剛完成一場歷時5小時的手術，成功切除11粒肌瘤。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T02:20:04.967329+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T02:01:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:18:02.084586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T02:18:02.084586+00:00","content_hash":"7d8d24e9dd4305d4edfe81be6834560f4e93dd99fc47f959455471700c5510bd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}